{"availability":"available","full":"lemonaide152/meld","name":"meld","description":"Self-host meld. One capability URL and one note saying what the exchange is for and what it is not for. 36 hours until the first reply; that reply sets 24 hours; each later reply resets 24 hours. Reads do not extend the clock. Expired or unknown is 404. Host-readable while live. Not for secrets.","category":"Productivity","language":"Python","stars":1,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-20T06:01:44Z","updated":"2026-10-08T18:14:34Z","license":"MIT","branch":"main","homepage":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld","topics":["agent-to-agent","ai-agents","caddy","context-sharing","docker","ephemeral"],"demo":"https://meld.mergeinc.workers.dev/","color":"#323057","ink":"#d6caff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","discoveredVia":[{"kind":"x","name":"As Seen On X.com","url":"https://x.com/i/web/status/2108380758566162801","postId":"2108380758566162801","postedAt":"2026-10-09T02:15:19.000Z"}],"metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.547Z","stars":1,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Python"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Put working context on a capability URL. Neither side pastes the block. Party A creates the link. One note says what the exchange is for and what it is not for. A sends that URL to B privately. The conversation stays on that link.","The bridge stays open while the exchange is active. Until the first reply, the hop stays open 36 hours from creation. The first reply sets a 24 hour timer. Each later reply is kept. Each later reply resets that 24 hours. There is no maximum lifetime once replies have started. A read does not start the timer. A read does not reset the timer.","When the window ends, the host dissolves the meld. Dissolve deletes the bridge. The next request for that code is 404. A code that never existed is 404. An expired code is 404. The response is the same."],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"18d5d598d249466cf9af2ed5c8b86a436ea42c3be5e9ad40c1bca7ad1e38f092","extractedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Put working context on a capability URL. Neither side pastes the block. Party A creates the link. One note says what the exchange is for and what it is not for. A sends that URL to B privately. The conversation stays on that link.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"hosting","status":"documented","text":"Self-host is the path.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"18d5d598d249466cf9af2ed5c8b86a436ea42c3be5e9ad40c1bca7ad1e38f092","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-08T18:14:34Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/lemonaide152/meld/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-09T10:25:15.130Z","hash":"18d5d598d249466cf9af2ed5c8b86a436ea42c3be5e9ad40c1bca7ad1e38f092","originalBytes":3916,"storedBytes":3916,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["reply","docker","does","meld","note","same","code","api","bash","host","context","read","timer.","url","what","build","compose","customer","data.","design","each","first","get","hours","it.","link.","meld.","melds","open","passwords","post","review.","while","bridge","bridge.","deletes","exchange","expired","ghcr.io","keep","later","one","plaintext","privately.","public","reply.","sends","stays","venv","caddy","capability","card","creation.","dissolve","dissolved","env","exchange.","for.","hour","hours.","json","latest","lemonaide152","live","live.","next","put","python","replies","request","reset","resets","resol